<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Shoulders for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>Our pre-raid best in slot is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69582/skullpiercer-pauldrons">
<img alt="Skullpiercer Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skullpiercer Pauldrons</span></a> from the new Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a> dungeon. <br/>
<br/>A very strong alternative option is using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60417/vicious-gladiators-scaled-shoulders">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Scaled Shoulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_pvppaladin_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Scaled Shoulders</span></a> for the Vicious Gladiator 2-set bonus for +70 Strength, by using the shoulders &amp; gloves, which also gives us the glove bonus (+5% increased <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=35395/crusader-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_crusaderstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader Strike</span></a> damage). Once you've picked up the Tier 11 gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60345/reinforced-sapphirium-gauntlets">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Gauntlets</span></a> however, you will want to drop the PvP items and instead use the Tier 11 2-set bonus. These PvP pieces are very easy to farm, as you can get the required <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> extremely quickly through arena or rated battlegrounds. There is no minimum rating requirement for these items. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62345/greater-inscription-of-jagged-stone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_emeraldrough_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone</span></a>, requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
