<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Back for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>Our pre-raid best in slot is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58190/floating-web">
<img alt="Floating Web" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Floating Web</span></a>, purchased with 1250x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. This cape is the best itemized 359 item level cape before you step foot into any raids. <br/>
<br/>The second best cape is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67140/drape-of-inimitable-fate">
<img alt="Drape of Inimitable Fate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Inimitable Fate</span></a>, which is a random BoE world drop - while richer players could spend money on this pre-raid, it's much easier to simply farm valor points for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58190/floating-web">
<img alt="Floating Web" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Floating Web</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>A really solid and easy early pickup is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69572/hex-lords-bloody-cloak">
<img alt="Hex Lord's Bloody Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hex Lord's Bloody Cloak</span></a> from the new Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a> dungeon. You can run this until you earn enough valor points to replace it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58190/floating-web">
<img alt="Floating Web" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Floating Web</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a> is a solid temporary cape option that you will unlock once you've hit Exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>. Even though this is a tanking cape, due to the high item level and the ability to reforge the dodge, it's actually better than you may initially believe. <br/>
<br/>Until you get one of the epic options listed above, I've also listed three strong capes from dungeons, with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56397/geordans-cloak">
<img alt="Geordan's Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Geordan's Cloak</span></a> being the strongest of the three in most setups. <br/>
<br/>
<i>The best enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a>, making Tailoring a best in slot profession for Phase 2, otherwise the best enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a>. Until you can get required <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52722/maelstrom-crystal">
<img alt="Maelstrom Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_crystalepic.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maelstrom Crystal</span></a> for this, the next best enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74230/enchant-cloak-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Critical Strike</span></a>. </i>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Back Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a> for Tailors, otherwise <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74230/enchant-cloak-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Critical Strike</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
