<img alt="Boots of Sullen Rock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Sullen Rock</span></a>
<br/>
