<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Neck for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67138/buc-zakai-choker">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Choker</span></a> is technically better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62447/gift-of-nadun">
<img alt="Gift of Nadun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea7.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gift of Nadun</span></a>, but it is an incredibly rare BoE random world drop and will be very expensive.<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62447/gift-of-nadun">
<img alt="Gift of Nadun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea7.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gift of Nadun</span></a> is a pretty easy option to acquire as it only requires reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>. <br/>Until you get one of the epic options, you can pick up <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57930/pendant-of-quiet-breath">
<img alt="Pendant of Quiet Breath" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_silverjadenecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Quiet Breath</span></a> in exchange for some <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
