<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Rings for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>One of the best pre-raid rings is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67139/blauvelts-family-crest">
<img alt="Blauvelt's Family Crest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blauvelt's Family Crest</span></a>, which is a BoE random world drop. If you don't have extra gold to spare, you may not be able to buy one of these. <br/>The other best pre-raid ring is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58185/band-of-bees">
<img alt="Band of Bees" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Bees</span></a> which costs 1250x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. This is essentially a carbon copy of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67139/blauvelts-family-crest">
<img alt="Blauvelt's Family Crest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blauvelt's Family Crest</span></a> with the exact same stats. <br/>The only other epic ring available pre-raid is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69563/ring-of-the-numberless-brood">
<img alt="Ring of the Numberless Brood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_zulgurub_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Numberless Brood</span></a> from the new Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a> dungeon, so you'll probably be using this if you don't want to pay gold for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67139/blauvelts-family-crest">
<img alt="Blauvelt's Family Crest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blauvelt's Family Crest</span></a>. This ring is basically just <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58185/band-of-bees">
<img alt="Band of Bees" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Bees</span></a> with a slightly lower item level.<br/>
<br/>There are numerous rare 346 item level ring options, with the best of them being the crafted BoE <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69852/punishers-band">
<img alt="Punisher's Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Punisher's Band</span></a>, mostly due to having a gem socket. This is a Jewelcrafted BoE, thus it costs some gold to craft or buy on the auction house. Grab whatever rare 346 item level rings you can farm or afford in the meantime until you're able to grab the epic options. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> (<i>enchanters only</i>).<div class="pad"></div>
