<td>
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Optional</td>
<td>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62350/gorsiks-band-of-shattering">
<img alt="Gorsik's Band of Shattering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringd.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gorsik's Band of Shattering</span></a></td>
