<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Two-Handed Weapons for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> is our pre-raid best in slot outside of the 372 PvP weapons, and obviously due to the heavy RNG involved in obtaining this weapon not everyone will have this. 0.2 slower weapon speed being equivalent to around 9 extra item levels or 2% extra damage, our options are limited. This means that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> will last you until the Heroic 372 item level weapons, and is only slightly worse than the Heroic 3.6 speed options from raids. The 3.6 speed 372 item level PvP weapons like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67447/vicious-gladiators-greatsword">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pvp400_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword</span></a> should be about on par or slightly better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a>, but this requires 2200 arena rating on top of 3400x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> as well as having the original <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=61346/vicious-gladiators-greatsword">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pvp400_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword</span></a> - thus it may not be the most attainable pre-raid weapon for many players. It simply suffers due to being a faster 3.6 speed and missing a secondary stat. <br/>
<br/>The 3.8 speed 346 item level weapons such as <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62454/blade-of-the-fearless">
<img alt="Blade of the Fearless" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blade of the Fearless</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56342/sword-of-the-bottomless-pit">
<img alt="Sword of the Bottomless Pit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword of the Bottomless Pit</span></a> are slightly better than the 359 item level PvP weapons like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=61346/vicious-gladiators-greatsword">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pvp400_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword</span></a>, due to the slower speed and extra secondary stat. Only get <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62454/blade-of-the-fearless">
<img alt="Blade of the Fearless" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blade of the Fearless</span></a> if you have commendations after getting <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68712/impatience-of-youth">
<img alt="Impatience of Youth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_idol_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Impatience of Youth</span></a>, our best in slot phase trinket. <br/>
<br/>There is also a weapon from the new Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a> dungeon - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69592/reforged-trollbane">
<img alt="Reforged Trollbane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reforged Trollbane</span></a>. This is an epic weapon with a 353 item level. Due to having 3.6 speed, however, it falls below <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=61346/vicious-gladiators-greatsword">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pvp400_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Greatsword</span></a> but lands above the 3.6 speed rare options like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65165/foe-reaper">
<img alt="Foe Reaper" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Foe Reaper</span></a>. For those of you who don't want to bother with Archaeology, this is a great weapon option that can easily last you until you get one of the raid weapons.<br/>
<br/>At the very bottom we have the weaker, faster options like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63445/arced-war-axe">
<img alt="Arced War Axe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arced War Axe</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56284/whitefin-axe">
<img alt="Whitefin Axe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_2h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Whitefin Axe</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<i>Until you can get required <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52722/maelstrom-crystal">
<img alt="Maelstrom Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_crystalepic.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maelstrom Crystal</span></a> for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74246/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>, the best weapon enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Berserking</span></a>. </i>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74246/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Berserking</span></a>
