<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="librams-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Librams for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best relic/<wbr/>libram is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64674/relic-of-aggramar">
<img alt="Relic of Aggramar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Aggramar</span></a>, which can be purchased with 700x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. This is also your Phase 2 best in slot libram, so it's a high priority purchase from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> options. It does have expertise, so you have to make sure you can utilize the expertise without going over the cap, as a ton of gear this phase is loaded with expertise especially our Phase 2 best in slot trinket <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The second best libram is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62243/notched-jawbone">
<img alt="Notched Jawbone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Notched Jawbone</span></a> which is very close to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64674/relic-of-aggramar">
<img alt="Relic of Aggramar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Aggramar</span></a>, just slightly worse. Anytime you cannot use the expertise from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64674/relic-of-aggramar">
<img alt="Relic of Aggramar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Aggramar</span></a> however, it will be better, so this is a great slot to swap in order to remove excess expertise. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62243/notched-jawbone">
<img alt="Notched Jawbone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Notched Jawbone</span></a> is a BoE crafted Inscription item that can be purchased on the auction house. <br/>
<br/>Until you're able to get one of the librams listed above, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56279/conch-of-thundering-waves">
<img alt="Conch of Thundering Waves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_shell_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conch of Thundering Waves</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63480/record-of-the-brotherhoods-end">
<img alt="Record of the Brotherhood's End" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Record of the Brotherhood's End</span></a> can hold you over as a temporary fix.<div class="pad"></div>
